  <para style="h">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Te</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Tesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Ñwed emi oto Pọl, Sailas ye Timoti. Enọ esọk mbon ufọk Abasi emi edude ke Tesalonika, mme mmọ emi edide inyene Abasi Ete ñnyin, ye eke Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Abasi Ete ye Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist akpakam ọnọ mbufo mfọn ye emem. <verse eid="2TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Ñnyin imenyene ndikọm Abasi kpukpru ini kabaña mbufo, nditọ ete. Edi nnen nnen ñkpọ ñnyin ndinam ntre, koro mbuọtidem mbufo ke ọkọri eti eti. Ndien ima emi mbufo enyenede ebaña kiet eken konyuñ okpon eti eti.<verse eid="2TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndutuhọ Enyene Ntak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ntak edi emi ñnyin ke idem ñnyin iburede mbure ibaña mbufo ke otu mme ufọk Abasi. Ñnyin ibure mbure ibaña usuñ emi mbufo ekada iso ndiyọ ñnyuñ nnim ke akpanikọ, ke ufọt kpukpru mme ukọbọ ye ukut emi mbufo ebede ke esit. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Emi edi nnen nnen ediyarade edinen ikpe Abasi, koro ke ntak mme ñkpọ emi mbufo eyedi mme mmọ emi edotde ndida obio ubọñ Esie ñnyene, emi mbufo ekutde ukut ebaña, <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Abasi eyenam se ifọnde. Enye eyeda ukut odori mme mmọ oro esinde mbufo ke ukut.<verse eid="2TH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Ndien Enye eyenọ mbufo emi ekutde ukut ifure, ye ñnyin nde. Enye edinam emi ke ini Ọbọñ Jisọs editode ke enyọñ iwọrọ iwut idem, ye mme ñkpọsọñ enjel Esie, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />ye edeme ikañ, ndimia mme mmọ emi midiọñọke Abasi ufen, ye mme mmọ emi misukke ibuot inọ Eti Mbuk emi abañade Ọbọñ Jisọs. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Mmọ eyebọ ufen nsinsi nsobo, eyediañade mmọ ekpọñ iso Ọbọñ ye ke ñkoñkoñ odudu Esie, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />ke ini Enye edidide ke usen oro ndibọ ubọñ nto kpukpru ikọt Esie, ye ukpono nto kpukpru mme mmọ emi enimde ke akpanikọ. Mbufo ñko eyedu ke otu mmọ, koro mbufo ñko emenim Eti Etop emi ñnyin iketiñde inọ mbufo ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ntak edi emi ñnyin isinde mbufo ke akam kpukpru ini. Ñnyin ibeñe Abasi ñnyin anam mbufo edot ke uwem emi Enye okokotde mbufo ndidu. Yak Enye, ke odudu Esie, anam kpukpru uduak esit mbufo ewọrọ esu ke eti, onyuñ anam utom mbuọtidem mbufo ọyọhọ. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Ke usuñ emi ke enyiñ Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs ọbọ ubọñ oto mbufo, mbufo ñko enyuñ ebọ eto Enye, ke mfọn Abasi ñnyin ye Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Edifiak Ndi Kraist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Ke se itukde edidi Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist, ye editañ ñnyin mbok ọtọkiet ye Enye, ami mekpe mbufo ubọk nditọ ete, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />ekusọp etimerede ekikere mbufo mme ndiyak etimede mbufo ke emi edọhọde ete usen Ọbọñ ama ededi. Ekeme ndidi eketiñ emi ke prọfesi mme ke edikwọrọ ikọ. Mme ekeme-ndinyuñ ndọhọ nte ke ñnyin ikewewet emi ke ñwed. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Ekuyak owo ndomokiet ada mbufo anam ndisime ke usuñ baba kiet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 2:3">Koro usen oro ididighe tutu akpatre ndutime ada itie, ndien oburobut owo oro ọwọrọ owut idem, emi enimde enye enọ ikañ nsobo. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Enye eyefaña onyuñ atuaha ye kpukpru se mme owo ekponode, ye kpukpru mme ñkpri abasi emi mme owo enimde ke edisana. Enye eyemenede idem esie odori okoñ akan mmọ kpukpru, ndien oduk eketie ke esit edisana ebiet ukpono Abasi, onyuñ ọdọhọ ete ke imọ idi Abasi. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Nte mbufo itighi? Ami mma ntetiñ mme ñkpọ emi nnọ mbufo ke ini emi ami ñkodude ye mbufo. <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Edi enyene ñkpọ emi akpande enye nditibe idahaemi, ndien mbufo emefiọk se ñkpọ oro edide. Ke edikem ini ndien, oburobut owo oro eyewọrọ owut idem.<verse eid="2TH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Mme ndedibe oburobut ido ema etetọñọ utom, edi se iditibede, iditibeke tutu emen enye emi omumde enye akama efep ke usuñ. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Do ndien ke oburobut owo oro ediwọrọ iwut idem, ndien Ọbọñ Jisọs eyewot enye ye ibifik emi ọwọrọde Enye ke inua, ndien onyuñ osobo enye oto ke utibe ediwọrọ ñwut idem Esie, ke Enye ama edi. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Oburobut owo oro edidi ye odudu Setan onyuñ anam kpukpru mme utibe ñkpọ ye mme nsu nsu idiọñọ ye mme ñkpọ ñyọ. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Ndien eyeda kpukpru mme oruk oburobut abiaña etiene mme mmọ emi editakde. Mmọ editak koro mmọ ikadarake inyuñ ima akpanikọ man otodo enyaña mmọ. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ke ntak emi Abasi ọdọñ odudu ndudue ndinam utom ke idem mmọ man otodo mmọ enim nsu ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Ibọrọ edi ntem, kpukpru mme mmọ emi mikenimke ke akpanikọ edi enyenede inemesit ke idiọkñkpọ, eyesobo mmọ. <verse eid="2TH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Ñnyin inyene ndikọm Abasi kpukpru ini kabaña mbufo, nditọ Ete, mbufo emi Abasi amade. Koro Abasi emek mbufo nte mme mmọ emi enyenede ndibem iso ñnyaña, ke odudu Edisana Spirit, ndinam mbufo ndisana ikọt Abasi, oto ke mbuọtidem emi mbufo ebuọtde ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Abasi okobot mbufo kabaña emi oto ke Eti Mbuk emi ñnyin ikọkwọrọde inọ mbufo, Enye okokot mbufo edibọ udeme ubọñ Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ke ntre, nditọ ete, esọñọ eda, enyuñ emum akpanikọ oro ñnyin ikekpepde mbufo ke edikọkwọrọ ye ke mme ñwed ñnyin ekama.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist ke idem Esie, ye Abasi Ete ñnyin, emi akamade ñnyin, ndien ke mbọm Esie ama ọnọ ñnyin nsinsi nsọñidem ye mfọnmma idorenyin, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />akpakam ọyọhọ esit mbufo ye idọñesit onyuñ anam mbufo esọñ idem ke edinam ye editiñ kpukpru se ifọnde.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Sọñọ Mum Akpanikọ Kama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ke akpatre, nditọ ete, ebọñ akam ebaña ñnyin, ete yak Etop Ọbọñ aka iso nditara usọp usọp, onyuñ ọbọ ubọñ kpa nte eketibede ke otu mbufo. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Ebọñ akam ñko ete Abasi anyaña ñnyin osio ke ubọk mme oburobut ye mme ndiọi owo koro midighe kpukpru owo enim Eti Etop emi ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Edi Abasi edi anam akpanikọ. Enye eyenam mbufo ekop nsọñidem, onyuñ ekpeme mbufo man oburobut owo oro. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Ndien Abasi ọnọ ñnyin idorenyin ke idem mbufo, ñnyin imenyene iwuk ite mbufo ke enam, eyenyuñ eka iso ndinam se ñnyin itiñde inọ mbufo. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Abasi akpakam ada esit mbufo usuñ ọkọsuñọ ke ima Abasi ye ime emi Kraist ọnọde.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpan Editi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Ke enyiñ Ọbọñ Kraist ñnyin imowuk mbufo, nditọ ete: ediañade nsaña ye kpukpru nditọ ete emi edude uwem ifu, emi mitieneke mme item emi ñnyin ikọnọde mmọ. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Mbufo ke idem mbufo emetim efiọk ete ke ana mbufo enam ukem ukem se ñnyin ikanamde: ñnyin ikedighe mbon ifu ke ini emi ñnyin ikodude ye mbufo. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Ñnyin ikọbọhọ uñwam ito owo ndomokiet itre ndikpe ñkpọ ke esit. Utu ke oro, ñnyin ikanam utom inyuñ ikut ukut, ke uwemeyo ye ke okoneyo, ñnyin ikaka iso ndinam utom man ñnyin ididi mbiomo inọ owo mbufo ndomokiet. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Ñnyin ikanam emi, idighe koro ñnyin mikenyeneke unen ndibup mbufo se ñnyin ikananade, ñnyin ikanam emi ndidi uwutñkpọ nnọ mbufo nditiene. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ke ini emi ñnyin ikodude ye mbufo ñnyin ima itiñ inọ mbufo ite: “Owo ekededi emi miyomke ndinam utom inaha eyak enye adia udia.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ñnyin itiñ emi koro ñnyin imokop ite ke ubak mme owo edu ke otu mbufo emi edude uwem ifu, emi minamke ñkpọ ndomokiet ebe ndisin enyin ke mme mbubehe mme mmọ efen. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Ke enyiñ Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist ñnyin imowuk inyuñ iduri mme mmọ oro utọñ ite: yak mmọ edu uwem eke odotde, enyuñ enam utom enyene se mmọ edade edu uwem. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ama edi mbufo, nditọ ete, mbufo inyeneke ndikpa mba ke edinam eti ñkpọ.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Owo ekeme ndidu ke otu mbufo emi midisukke ibuot inọ etop emi ñnyin inọde esọk mbufo ke ñwed emi, edieke edide ntre, etiñ enyin ese utọ owo oro, ekunyene ñkpọ ndomokiet ndinam ye enye, man otodo enye okop but. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Edi ekunam ñkpọ ye enye nte owo usua, utu ke oro eduri enye utọñ nte eyen ete. <verse eid="2TH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Yak Ọbọñ ke idem Esie, emi edide ebiet emi emem ñnyin otode, ọnọ mbufo emem ke kpukpru ini ye ke kpukpru usuñ, Ọbọñ odu ye kpukpru mbufo. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Ami ñwet ñwed emi ke ubọk mi: Ekọm emi oto Pọl. Emi edi usuñ emi nsiwetde enyiñ mi ke kpukpru ñwed mi. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Yak mfọn Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist odu ye kpukpru mbufo.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>